OL,3,GNEWSAAre more people learning the
OL,4,Asecret to turning 100?
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We are pleased to know you are
OL,7,Fcelebrating your 100th birthday," says
OL,8,FMarie Stothard.
OL,10,FShe is reading a message from King
OL,11,FCharles III and Queen Camilla in a card
OL,12,Fwhich she holds in her delicate hands.
OL,14,FA smiling photograph of the King and
OL,15,FQueen is displayed on the front.
OL,17,FMarie is surrounded by her children,
OL,18,Fgrandchildren and great-grandchildren
OL,19,Fin a function room on the top floor of
OL,20,Fthe care home where she lives in Hull.
